**Read:** [Aluminium Automotive Manual — European Aluminium and collaborators](../sources/Aluminium-Automotive-Manual.lingua#r_73MPKA19MDBSQ96195B818Z49T), all Materials, Products, Manufacturing, and Joining chapters and selected full application cases; [Metals, alloys, steels, and graduate modeling — Bhadeshia teaching materials](../sources/Metals-Alloys-and-Graduate-Teaching-Bhadeshia.lingua#r_0HZJKN8WC6SEWA0DABM8P4HC3F), the complete aluminium, precipitation, joining, and advanced-alloy material; [Metais Não Ferrosos e suas Ligas — Cassio Barbosa](../sources/Metais-Nao-Ferrosos-e-Suas-Ligas-Barbosa.lingua#r_0FJ1378X0JMVHYVBFAXGK2399D), the full aluminium chapter and original references, when available; [Non-ferrous Metals Industries — European Commission BREF](../sources/Nonferrous-Metals-Industries-BREF.lingua#r_19ZD7KKDWVWM20MXVNCQZJMCDB), the whole primary/secondary aluminium quality account.

Aluminium products range from nominally pure conductors to cast and wrought alloys with different chemistry, phase constitution, defects, and treatment. Alloy designation, casting/forming behavior, precipitation, corrosion, joining, and surface requirements must be connected to actual product specifications and service conditions.

Distinguish melt purification/cleaning, alloy adjustment, solidification, thermomechanical work, solution/age treatment, and joining. Oxides, dissolved gases, intermetallic phases, inclusions, segregation, porosity, and texture can affect useful performance in different ways. A chemically correct charge alone does not establish the final structure or defect population.

Recycled feed introduces collection/sorting, coatings/attachments, alloy mixtures, oxidation/dross, impurities, and uncertain history. Compare loops using delivered quality and actual useful recovery. A high recycled mass fraction can be a useful measure while still omitting the primary dilution, separation, energy, and residual work required.

**Work:** reconstruct a complete cast and a wrought aluminium product case, including one secondary-feed route. Independently check a charge/impurity and material-loss account, then connect measured structure and properties with the actual processing history. Compare an alternative feed/heat-treatment/fabrication choice against a specified function. Use the later solidification, forming, precipitation, and testing studies to defend the mechanistic explanation.

**Continue:** [Follow sulfide copper through matte, slag, gas, conversion, and refining feed](Copper-sulfide-smelting-conversion-and-sulfur-systems.lingua#r_2GZT07FQCPW7HY4VB6CDWVWT3N).

